 166:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c **** /*
 167:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****  * Unlocks a queue locked by a call to prvLockQueue.  Locking a queue does not
 168:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****  * prevent an ISR from adding or removing items to the queue, but does prevent
 169:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****  * an ISR from removing tasks from the queue event lists.  If an ISR finds a
 170:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****  * queue is locked it will instead increment the appropriate queue lock count
 171:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****  * to indicate that a task may require unblocking.  When the queue in unlocked
