2821:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * 'Restricted' in its name.  It is not part of the public API.  It is
2822:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * designed for use by kernel code, and has special calling requirements.
2823:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * It can result in vListInsert() being called on a list that can only
2824:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * possibly ever have one item in it, so the list will be fast, but even
2825:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * so it should be called with the scheduler locked and not from a critical
2826:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          * section. */
