2830:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          *  list.  It will not block until the scheduler is unlocked - at which
2831:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/queue.c ****          *  time a yield will be performed.  If an item is added to the queue while
